(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 355.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid da4418af-3b74-5cb0-95be-e4145b674e08))
(text "EC enumerates over Mu USB2_P3 only after the carrier-generated physical INTERNAL_USB_VBUS is above the supervisor threshold. U61 defaults disconnected so an always-powered EC cannot back-drive an off host PHY." (at 20.32 363.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 6126e2c5-8ac0-5922-aed5-06da406fa963))
(text "The verified B160QAN03.K panel is non-touch; USB2_P4 is paired with native USB-C port 2." (at 20.32 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 238195d0-f0a2-51aa-bdf5-17c42b9c3988))
(text "Trackpad uses Mu USB2_P8 as a direct internal USB HID device. TRACKPAD_FAULT_N is pulled up to the EC; S3 removes trackpad VBUS, so wake-from-trackpad is not supported." (at 20.32 378.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 626e9b5f-bc4b-5678-9474-7c5efcc1437d))
(text "The Intehill controller remains a bench fixture/fallback and is not populated on the motherboard." (at 20.32 386.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 054e3655-16ab-5a2d-af30-5ef40f2ccc64))
(text "J52 is released for Delta BFB04512HHA-CZ0T: fused MU_12V, 8.2k/3.9n FG interface, and 25kHz open-drain PWM. Floating PWM commands full speed; firmware never drives the fan PWM node high." (at 20.32 393.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid b676adad-45e8-5ee9-94ba-e3ab07d74357))
(text "Delta contract: 0.26A maximum, 35% minimum start duty, FG is open collector at 2 pulses/revolution, and 0% PWM stops the fan. Gate pull-down makes an unpowered/reset EC command full fan speed, not fan-off." (at 20.32 401.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 1ebfb903-1a2f-5721-bfb8-88f71f3c20ee))
(text "Thermal control has separate skin/hinge and Mu heatsink NTCs on ADC-capable EC pins." (at 20.32 408.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 88d29eda-fa5d-5a4f-abb5-9c1385bd2c0c))
(text "The blower shares MU_12V: it is available whenever the Mu is powered. Thermal policy commands full fan and host throttle/shutdown before any final MU_12V cut; after a cut the passive coldplate/heatpipe/fin stack absorbs residual heat while heat generation is removed." (at 20.32 416.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid cbe0c32b-efd7-5292-83fb-9cfae3920cb4))
(text "Cooling default is copper spreader/heatpipe/vapor chamber plus the released Delta blower; no Peltier/TEC in the base design. Solid-state AirJet-style modules are a future mechanical option only." (at 20.32 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid 18fcb4fd-982e-5e34-8673-d0ae07464b4b))
